stry research, systematically identify new opportunities, select amongst them, and validate opportunities by designing experiments and prototypes. The class is taught in an experiential \"studio\" format, i.e. all skills are learned by applying them in building a real world product to address a validated need. Participants assemble teams with the requisite skills and receive extensive feedback on their work from their peers and industry professionals. Some participants go on to further develop these products and launch them as full-time startup founders, or product champions within established companies.", "catalogBreadth": "", "catalogDistr": "", "catalogEnrollmentPriority": null, "catalogLang": "", "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": "", "catalogAttribute": "", "catalogWhenOffered": "Fall.", "catalogComments": "", "catalogPrereqCoreq": "", "catalogPrereq": null, "catalogCoreq": null, "catalogFee": "", "catalogSatisfiesReq": "", "catalogPermission": "Enrollment limited to: Cornell Tech students.", "catalogCourseSubfield": "", "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "GR", "acadGroup": "CT", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2797, "crseId": 371181, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "TECH", "catalogNbr": "5901", "titleShort": "Preparing for Studio", "titleLong": "Preparing for Studio", "crseAttrs": [], "crseAttrValueGroups": [], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "LEC", "ssrComponentLong": "Lecture", "section": "030", "classNbr": 18714, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "02:45PM", "timeEnd": "05:15PM", "startDt": "10/21/2021", "endDt": "10/21/2021", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 6, "netid": "kg488", "firstName": "Karan", "middleName": "", "lastName": "Girotra"}, {"instrAssignSeq": 5, "netid": "jh2687", "firstName": "Josh", "middleName": "", "lastName": "Hartmann"}], "pattern": "R", "facilityDescr": "To Be Assigned", "bldgDescr": null, "facilityDescrshort": "25L", "meetingTopicDescription": ""}, {"classMtgNbr": 2, "timeS